What happens if we don't mention @Service? (Short Interview Answer)

If a class is not annotated with @Service (or another Spring stereotype like @Component), Spring will not create a bean for that class.

public class PaymentService {
}


Spring ignores this class during component scanning.

If you Autowire it
@Autowired
